      "text": "[~ 1]"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main1020_swimmerm_02",
      "hash": "afd9541bd2e47b7c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main1020_swimmerm_03",
      "hash": "afd9551bd2e47d2f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_01",
      "hash": "a7661d11c28260fc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: We’d heard there were loads of rare\\nPokémon in that GO Park place, so we came to\\r\\ncheck it out for ourselves..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "63dae89e4730b568",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: But it was so complicated. App this and\\nconnectivity that...\\c\\nIt was so creepy, we had to get out of there."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main1020_nyasu_01",
      "hash": "9cf6c3ec7942f750",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "MEOWTH: Mrowr..."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "63daeb9e4730ba81",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_02",
      "hash": "a7662011c2826615",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: Why can’t I just trip over a get-rich-quick\\nscheme already?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_09",
      "hash": "a7662511c2826e94",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hm? Feels like I just kicked something\\nreally hard."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_03",
      "hash": "63daea9e4730b8ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: Could it be some kind of treasure?\\nAt last, our big score! Let’s see what it is!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_03",
      "hash": "a7661f11c2826462",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE & JAMES: Heave-ho!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_04",
      "hash": "63daed9e4730bde7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main1020_nyasu_02",
      "hash": "9cf6c6ec7942fc69",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 13]"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_04",
      "hash": "a7661a11c2825be3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: Wow! Just look at that shine!\\nThis must be some amazing treasure!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_05",
      "hash": "a7661911c2825a30",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...As if! Yuck!\\nWhat are these? Some kind of [VAR COLOR(0006)]Gold Teeth[VAR COLOR(0000)]?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_05",
      "hash": "63daec9e4730bc34",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: T-teeth? No matter how gold they are,\\nsome things just aren’t worth the effort..."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_06",
      "hash": "a7661c11c2825f49",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 17]"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_07",
      "hash": "a7661b11c2825d96",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: Ah, it’s the twerp!\\nWhat’re you doing here?\\c\\nNever mind that—take these off our hands!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main1020_sys_02",
      "hash": "1ed557a826255042",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You had a pair of [VAR COLOR(0006)]Gold Teeth [VAR COLOR(0000)]thrust upon you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main1020_kojiro_06",
      "hash": "63daef9e4730c14d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: We’re busy, so you take care of\\nwhatever those are for us!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main1020_musashi_08",
      "hash": "a7662611c2827047",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: That’s right! Now’s the time for our\\nfantastic getaway!"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
